note right of s0
no live allocation yet
end note
state "已核查本侧各线程释放前置路径" as s1
note right of s1
logical history fact; not all threads must finish before the
first thread enters free
end note
state "已记录本侧各线程进入free" as s2
note right of s2
thread instances remain distinct; no paired completion follows
from this record
end note
state "已记录本侧allocation结果" as s3
note right of s3
allocation live; per-stage read/write protocol separate
end note
state "已记录CTA放弃再分配许可" as s4
note right of s4
no subsequent alloc by this CTA; no deallocation implied
end note
state "已记录本侧warp dealloc操作（非配对完成时刻）" as s5
note right of s5
local operation evidence only; paired participation needs the
separate validity rule; no physical paired-completion timestamp
end note
