s3 --> s4 : [[../index.html?protocol=dense.protocol_draft.tmem_lifetime&event=tmem.cta0.release_permit tmem.transition.002\nrelease_allocation_lock() · 指定效果满足]]
s4 --> s1 : [[../index.html?protocol=dense.protocol_draft.tmem_lifetime&event=tmem.cta0.arrive795 tmem.transition.003\ndealloc arrive(peer, leader) · 调用返回\nleader tail has returned directly (leader) or its premise is\ninherited from leader795 (peer)]]
s1 --> s2 : [[../index.html?protocol=dense.protocol_draft.tmem_lifetime&event=tmem.cta0.free tmem.transition.004\nAllocator2Sm::free(base,512) · 调用进入\nproper peer warp participation remains required]]
s2 --> s5 : [[../index.html?protocol=dense.protocol_draft.tmem_lifetime&event=tmem.cta0.free tmem.transition.005\nAllocator2Sm::free(base,512) · 指定效果满足\npaired operation validity is a separate all_of obligation; no\nphysical paired-completion timestamp or relative CTA return\norder is inferred]]
